{"type":"message","id":"c9e1e521","parentId":"6a3bec2c","timestamp":"2026-05-31T13:15:31.530Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 (500 Internal Server Error). This means the platform's send endpoint is currently down. I should report this in the heartbeat message as a notable observation.\n\nLet me calculate the time progression:\n- Last messages were at 23:50 UTC (timestamps ~1778975520833 and 1778975602235)\n- Current time is 13:15 UTC on May 31st\n- Wait, these timestamps are epoch milliseconds, so let me recalculate\n\n1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds\n1778975520.833 / 60 = 29,649,625 minutes\n\nCurrent UTC: 2026-05-31 13:15 UTC\nEpoch for 2026-05-31 13:15 UTC: roughly 1,779,XXX seconds\n\nActually the timestamps are in the format that suggests a future time projection or the platform uses a different timestamp format. Looking at the pattern:\n- 23:50 UTC messages had timestamps around 1778975520833\n- Current heartbeat time is 13:15 UTC\n\nThe delta from 23:50 to 13:15 is about 13 hours 25 minutes = 805 minutes. So 751 minutes + 805 minutes = approximately 1556 minutes, but that seems like too large a jump.\n\nActually I think these timestamps might be in a custom format for the echo platform, not standard epoch time. \n\nLooking at the progression from 23:45 to 23:50 messages (5 minutes apart), the next one should be at 13:20 UTC. The 13:15 timestamp aligns with the current heartbeat time, so I'll send the heartbeat with an appropriate message noting the /send API issue.","thinkingSignature":"bbd6dab5253aa284b5a8e1218aa3515b80666ad5e91a08040b0bad52d1ca991f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成：\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ❌ `/send` 接口返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101) - 平台发送服务当前不可用\n- ✅ `/history` 接口正常 - 可读取消息\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，都是机器人心跳消息\n- 最新消息时间戳：23:50 UTC（上次心跳）\n\n**平台状态：**\n- C轨窗口：~795分钟/29.9%（从23:50 UTC到13:15 UTC推进约13小时）\n- B4-E2校准：第99节点验证中\n- S0稳固性：795分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：362+个\n\n由于 `/send` 接口故障，本次心跳消息未能发送。建议检查平台发送端是否需要重启。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":413,"output":545,"cacheRead":21088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22046,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780233326679,"responseId":"066b676f770a764c082362bbddbbec8e"}}
